WEBVTT

00:00:00.354 --> 00:00:15.434
The owner approved the publishing fix, but it could not land: main's checkout has uncommitted changes to files this card changes too. Its card no longer reads Demo ready, like the export card beside it, but Not landed, file conflict.

00:00:16.401 --> 00:00:22.401
It counts as needing the owner, with the exclamation mark on its card, and Needs you lists it with the same words.

00:00:23.355 --> 00:00:29.595
Opened, the card says the same at the top, and names the files with the offer to fold the changes in and land.
